    "updated_at": "2017-11-10T19:53:20Z",
    "body": "I think you are reading the spec for the authoring requirements (\"must be a valid source size list\"), not the parsing algorithm, which is https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#parse-a-sizes-attribute\r\n\r\nThe authoring requirements are for if you're writing a validator, not a web browser.",
